# Research data cache: large, re-fetchable from Alpaca; never committed.
research/data/
# Transient per-run handoff/report artifacts (regenerated every run).
research/candidate.json
research/report.txt
research/proposal_prompt.txt
# NOTE: research/trials.jsonl (the trial registry) and research/proposals/*.json
# (strategy specs) are deliberately COMMITTED, not ignored. The registry is the
# denominator of every deflated-Sharpe claim and the burn-once gate memory — it
# must persist across clones, or N resets to 0 and the honesty machinery breaks.
